{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6108","title":"POCO Introduces POCO X8 Pro Series, Pushing Next-Gen Performance to the Max","desc":"POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today introduced POCO X8 Pro Max, POCO X8 Pro, and the exclusive POCO X8 Pro - Iron Man Edition, shifting its X Series to X Pro Series.","view_cnt":"19148","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1773646346","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/467_operatorx_operatorx_opx/16/03/2026/04424b5a1fb82d17708c17e4d634be8e.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, March 17, 2026 — \u003c/strong\u003ePOCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today introduced POCO X8 Pro Max, POCO X8 Pro, and the exclusive POCO X8 Pro - Iron Man Edition, shifting its X Series to X Pro Series. With flagship performance, long-lasting endurance, premium design, and impressive experience, POCO X8 Pro Series breaks new ground in performance devices, redefining the limits of next-gen performance flagships.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\"With the new POCO X8 Pro Series, we've made cutting-edge technology and flagship-level experiences more accessible to users around the world,\" said Kang Lou, Senior Product Marketing Manager and Spokesperson at POCO Global. \"For the first time, we are introducing our Pro Max model — POCO X8 Pro Max — to push the boundaries of extreme performance. At the same time, POCO X8 Pro delivers an all-around enhanced experience with exceptional value, while POCO X8 Pro - Iron Man Edition takes our collaboration with Marvel to the next level.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlagship Performance Pushes Speed to the Max\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePerformance stands at the core of POCO X8 Pro Series. POCO X8 Pro Max globally debuts¹ as the first smartphone to be powered by the latest Dimensity 9000 series flagship chipset — Dimensity 9500s, achieving an impressive AnTuTu score of 3,085,998.² Built on a 3nm process, it features a 4+4 All Big Core CPU design with up to 3.73GHz max clock speed, further enhancing power efficiency. POCO X8 Pro Max supports LPDDR5X 9600Mbps RAM and UFS 4.1 storage,³ making everyday operations feel smooth and responsive. Meanwhile, POCO X8 Pro achieves a 15.8% increase in AnTuTu score⁴ compared to its predecessor with the global debut¹ of the Dimensity 8500-Ultra Mobile Platform, delivering a 25% boost in GPU performance⁵ and lower power consumption. Moreover, POCO X8 Pro Max and POCO X8 Pro both support hardware-level ray tracing,⁶ further enhancing in-game immersion with more realistic lighting and reflections.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/321_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/17/03/2026/dae73529a27e945be8682dd682fdb55b.jpg\" alt=\"The image shows a chip on a black background, labeled \u0026quot;MediaTek Dimensity 9500s.\u0026quot; Surrounding it are yellow lights that seem to be transmitting data, creating a technological atmosphere.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBeyond hardware, POCO X8 Pro Series integrates WildBoost Optimization to further elevate the gaming experience. It intelligently predicts per-frame computing demand within each frame generation cycle, enabling proactive intervention to prevent frame drops. As a result, both POCO X8 Pro Max and POCO X8 Pro deliver more stable frame rates and lower power consumption even under heavy-load gaming. Furthermore, WildBoost Optimization supports features⁷ including Smart frame rate,⁸ 1.5K Super resolution,⁹ 24x super resolution touch,¹⁰ and Game HDR,¹¹ enabling smooth gameplay beyond native frame limits, finer details, smoother swipes, and stunning graphics especially in demanding RPG games.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/683_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/16/03/2026/3cb59a94a03d9988104193d2d03c8cf4.jpg\" alt=\"A person is sitting on the ground, holding a mobile phone, with a game scene displayed on the screen. The background consists of striped flooring and an orange round coffee table. This person is wearing a long-sleeved shirt with multiple colors.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eCompleting the flagship performance experience is the LiquidCool Technology. POCO X8 Pro Max features the POCO 3D IceLoop Cooling System with a large 5,800mm² liquid cooling area and a specialized 3D bulge over the chipset, significantly improving thermal efficiency and drastically reducing SoC temperature by up to 3°C.¹² POCO X8 Pro adopts a 5,300mm² POCO 3D Dual-layer IceLoop Cooling System, allowing you to enjoy peak performance during intense gaming or heavy multitasking.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMassive Battery Meets Industry-Leading Charging\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO X8 Pro Max features the largest battery in POCO's history¹³ with an 8,500mAh (typ) battery capacity, delivering 2-day battery life¹⁴ on a single charge. It retains over 80% of its capacity even after 1,600 charge cycles, roughly equivalent to six years of regular use.¹⁵ Alternatively, POCO X8 Pro houses an upgraded 6,500mAh (typ) silicon-carbon battery, offering durable endurance in a more compact form. 100W HyperCharge¹⁶ and industry-leading 27W reverse charging¹⁷ are featured across the lineup, delivering all-around enhanced charging experiences.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/277_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/16/03/2026/1d5d89792b846f8b08f80c0e4de058ff.jpg\" alt=\"Two smartphones are placed on a brown box, connected together by a data cable. One smartphone's screen shows the time as 3:34, while the other displays the time as 15:34, with a background of some small stones.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFor both devices, Smart charging further enhances user experience by intelligently managing charging speed and power distribution between the system and the battery.¹⁸ It is designed to control device temperature, ensuring a safe, smooth, and stable charging process.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBrilliant Visuals, Immersive Audio\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO X8 Pro Max features a 6.83-inch display, while POCO X8 Pro is equipped with a 6.59-inch display, both reaching up to 3,500 nits peak brightness across 25%¹⁹ of the screen for excellent outdoor visibility. Built on flagship M10 panels integrating brand-new red luminous material, the entire lineup enhances luminous efficiency for brighter visuals while reducing power consumption. On POCO X8 Pro, red luminous material further boosts luminous efficiency by 20%²⁰ compared to its predecessor. POCO X8 Pro Series also supports 3840Hz PWM dimming and triple TÜV Rheinland eye-care certifications, ensuring both visibility and comfort in various lighting conditions. With an ultrasonic fingerprint sensor, POCO X8 Pro Max also provides an extremely fast and secure unlocking experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/560_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/16/03/2026/f43e91d7b83ec8f420c8b7b7950226dc.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eComplementing the display, POCO X8 Pro Max features dual 1115F symmetrical²¹ speakers with Hi-Res Audio and Dolby Atmos® for natural, authentic, and balanced sound. Personalized volume options cater to different listening scenarios, including a powerful 400% volume boost²² for open spaces and Nighttime low-volume mode for quiet environments such as bedtime.²³\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium by Design, Built to Last\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO X8 Pro Series embodies a minimalist, premium design with innovative features. With a metal frame and fiberglass back, POCO X8 Pro Max delivers a premium handfeel with an expansive screen. POCO X8 Pro stands out with ultra-slim bezels and a high screen-to-body ratio, offering a comfortable viewing experience within a compact and portable body. Both models feature racetrack-inspired camera decos integrated with a Dynamic RGB light, offering playful, customizable lighting effects that respond to notifications, charging, gaming,²⁴ music playback, and camera activity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/406_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/16/03/2026/f05a553bc7df04620c958f9c4ba3d6f9.jpg\" alt=\"A young woman is holding a black phone in a low-light environment, with two red lenses on the back of the phone, her expression focused. In the background, some blurred home elements and headphones can be seen.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eDurability marks a core pillar of the lineup, with both models featuring Corning® Gorilla® Glass 7i and a comprehensive suite of IP66, IP68, IP69, and IP69K²⁵ dust and water resistance ratings. Meanwhile, POCO X8 Pro Max has passed the 5-star SGS Premium Performance Certification,²⁶ verifying resistance to drops, crushing, and bending.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnhanced Imaging, Elevated Creativity\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eEngineered to deliver exceptional clarity in every shot, POCO X8 Pro Series combines powerful hardware with AI-driven enhancements, bringing elevated mobile photography to the entire lineup. Both models feature a 50MP main camera and a 20MP front camera, with POCO X8 Pro Max using a Light Fusion 600 image sensor and POCO X8 Pro equipped with a Sony IMX882 sensor for the main camera. Together, POCO X8 Pro Series delivers sharp, vivid shots with stable, high-quality performance across diverse lighting conditions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFor those seeking even more creativity, POCO X8 Pro Series also supports powerful shooting features such as UltraSnap and Dynamic shots, making fast, clear captures of continuous motion effortless. Seamless conversion between video and live photos is now supported across the lineup, while AI Creativity Assistant²⁷ simplifies editing and refining image quality.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/71_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/16/03/2026/086a2d14d8ae70c2342161bd42e0216d.jpg\" alt=\"Two people are sitting on the edge of a yellow shipping container, one wearing a loose-fitting top, while the other holds an instrument, with a background of blue sky and white clouds.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart, Connected, and Ready for Anything\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePowered by Xiaomi HyperOS 3,²⁸ POCO X8 Pro Series delivers an intelligent, responsive, and connected everyday experience. Xiaomi HyperConnect²⁹ ensures seamless interaction across devices, while Xiaomi HyperIsland³⁰ brings expanded live activity support for apps at a glance. Taking AI experience further, Google Gemini³² and Circle to Search³³ with Google offer smart assistance and fast information access. Featured for the first time, POCO X8 Pro Series introduces Ticket Purchase Mode,³¹ which can help you buy tickets faster during high-demand sales. It improves touch response and screen performance, and optimizes the phone's processing power to give you a smoother, faster experience when trying to get tickets.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eMaking its debut across POCO X Pro Series, Xiaomi Offline Communication³⁴ ensures voice calls even without a network. Designed for a more flexible lifestyle, POCO X8 Pro Max also supports eSIM,³⁵ simplifying setup and making international travel more convenient.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAdding even more value, POCO X8 Pro Series comes with an exclusive bundle of premium benefits, including a 3-month trial for Spotify Premium³⁶ and a 2-month trial for YouTube Premium³⁷ for free.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePOCO x Marvel: Ultimate Armor, Stronger Power\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBlending advanced technology with bold design, POCO deepens its collaboration with Marvel with POCO X8 Pro - Iron Man Edition, returning with unmatched performance in a striking new form. Building on POCO's fearless brand DNA and its relentless drive to push boundaries, this latest edition marks a new evolution — stronger, sharper, much like this next-gen golden armor.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/532_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/16/03/2026/d20c043469b24ba81b7d4b8eaa23b837.jpg\" alt=\"A mobile packaging box themed around Iron Man, featuring a red exterior, with a black phone placed beside it. The back is printed with an Iron Man graphic and the POCO logo, and there is a USB cable at the bottom. The overall background is a gradient of brown.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eInspired by one of Stark Industries' most powerful and iconic black-and-gold armors, POCO X8 Pro - Iron Man Edition features a sleek black body accented with shimmering golden streaks, with the flash serving as the Arc Reactor at its center. The full golden armor design stands out, with dazzling details completing the overall look, creating a striking, futuristic impression. Beyond the hardware, a newly customized Iron Man-themed UI extends the black-and-gold aesthetic into every interaction. When the device powers on, Iron Man awakens, delivering an immersive sci-fi experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/732_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/16/03/2026/e54792b853d62af28b93ae50d9c25263.jpg\" alt=\"A mobile phone displays a golden-themed interface on the front, showing the time as 03:36 and the date as December 18. The back of the phone features a \u0026quot;Iron Man\u0026quot; design, with an overall color scheme of black and gold, set against a dark surface background.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO X8 Pro Max is available in three colors: White, Black, and Blue.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIt will be available in two variants: 12GB+256GB and 12GB+512GB.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO X8 Pro is available in three colors: Black, White, and Mint Green.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIt will be available in three variants: 8GB+256GB, 8GB+512GB, and 12GB+512GB.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO X8 Pro - Iron Man Edition will be available in 12GB+512GB.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Availability may vary by countries/regions, you may consult third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePrice and availability vary between markets and sales channels. Please refer to \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/poco/\"\u003emi.com\u003c/a\u003e for product availability and detailed regional sales information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹ Global debut as of March 17, 2026.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e² Data tested based on AnTuTu V11.0.5 by POCO Internal Labs at around 25°C environmental temperature. Actual results may vary based on different testing conditions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³ UFS 4.1 refers to enhanced firmware capabilities compared with previous versions, offering improved data security and exception handling performance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁴ Data tested based on AnTuTu V11.0.8 by POCO Internal Labs at around 25°C environmental temperature. Actual results may vary based on different testing conditions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁵ GPU data are provided by MediaTek, and measured against last generation, actual performance may vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁶ Ray tracing on POCO X8 Pro Max and POCO X8 Pro is compatible with certain third-party games under specific user-selected settings, including Diablo Immortal. This information is provided for reference only and does not imply any endorsement, sponsorship, or affiliation with the above game rightholders. Ray tracing is available only in specific game scenarios and depends on game developer implementation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁷ 1.5K Super Resolution and Smart Frame Rate are supported as separate features and are available on POCO X8 Pro and POCO X8 Pro - Iron Man Edition via OTA starting from March 2026. Each feature is supported only by selected games, please refer to your actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁸ Smart frame rate is compatible with certain third-party games under specific user-selected settings, including international edition of Genshin Impact and Honkai: Star Rail (OpenGL only). This information is provided for reference only and does not imply any endorsement, sponsorship, or affiliation with the above game rightholders.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁹ Super resolution is compatible with certain third-party games under specific user-selected settings, including international edition of Genshin Impact and Honkai: Star Rail. This information is provided for reference only and does not imply any endorsement, sponsorship, or affiliation with the above game rightholders.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁰ 24x super resolution touch is activated under Game Turbo Mode.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹¹ Game HDR effect on games including but not limited to all games covered under the game category of the GetApps/Mi App Mall. Features may vary depending on software version. Please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹² Data come from POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary depending on different test environments and conditions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹³ POCO's biggest battery refers to its smartphone lineup only.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁴ The 2-day battery life is based on test results from POCO Internal Labs, measured under a simulated, comprehensive battery life scenario reflecting daily use (including typical smartphone activities such as home screen use, music playback, social media, email, maps, video streaming, standby, etc.). Actual results may vary due to differences in the testing environment, software version, network conditions, and individual usage patterns.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁵ This is from theoretical calculations based on test data certified by TÜV SÜD High Battery Endurance in Cycles. Simulated daily user habits (one full charge and discharge every 1.5 days). Over 80% of the battery's capacity is retained after 1600 complete charge cycles, which corresponds to over 6 years of usage. Actual results may vary depending on testing conditions and usage habits.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁶ 100W HyperCharge means the adapter output power is 100W. Actual power output may vary depending on the environment. Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁷ Supports up to 27W wired reverse charging, compatible with devices verified through POCO Internal Labs testing. Actual performance may vary depending on battery conditions and other factors. When using this feature, please ensure your phone has sufficient battery and verify the compatibility of the receiving device. 27W reverse charging of POCO X8 Pro for iPhone 17 series will only be available via OTA starting from around March 2026.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁸ Available only when using wired charging.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁹ Data obtained from POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary depending on testing environment, and software version, please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²⁰ The luminous efficiency data refers to red light efficiency, compared with POCO X7 Pro. Data obtained from POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary depending on testing environment, and software version, please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²¹ Symmetrical refers to the speaker components, not the exterior design.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²² 400% volume compared to the same model at 100% volume. This feature only applies to media sounds, ringtones, and notification sounds, not alarms. Only available in speaker mode, not with headphones. Volume data tested by POCO Internal Labs. Actual effects may vary due to software and scenarios. Please refer to your actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²³ The product supports finer adjustment of low volume. Actual effects may differ by system version and usage scenario, please refer to actual use experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²⁴ Game lighting effects are supported only by selected games under specific scenarios, please refer to your actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²⁵ The device is certified to be water and dust resistant exclusively under specific laboratory conditions not corresponding to normal use conditions. The warranty does not cover liquid damage caused by conditions other than test conditions. Ingress protection might deteriorate due to wear and tear, physical damage, and/or disassembly needed for repair. For more information, please see official website.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²⁶ The product has obtained SGS 5-stars Premium Performance Certification, indicating that it meets the SGS technical standards for drop resistance, bending resistance, and crush resistance. As a precision electronic product, there is still a risk of damage if the phone falls. Please be careful to avoid drops or collisions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²⁷ AI Creativity Assistant is available in select regions and device models. Some AI Creativity Assistant features require internet connection, and may vary by system software and Gallery Editor app versions. Please refer to actual use. Internet connection is required. Check responses for accuracy. The feature of Remove glare in AI Reflection Removal will be available via OTA starting from around March 2026.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²⁸ Availability of Xiaomi HyperOS 3 features, apps and services may vary depending on regions, software version and phone model.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e²⁹ Xiaomi HyperConnect features may vary by software version, device model, and compatibility, and require logging into the same Xiaomi account, with Bluetooth, WLAN, NFC, and \"Settings-Interconnectivity\" enabled. Please refer to actual use. Some features require both devices to be on the same network via Wi-Fi or hotspot, while others may require Xiaomi Cloud to be enabled. Apple devices need to have the latest version of \"Xiaomi Interconnectivity\" app installed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³⁰ Works on compatible apps and surfaces. Availability of specific features and services may vary depending on software version, apps, regions, and device models. Please refer to actual use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³¹ Ticket purchase mode is supported on Mi Calendar version G-17.1.5 or above, and requires Xiaomi HyperAI Engine version 3.18.0 or above. Function availability is scheduled via OTA starting from around May 2026. Ticket purchase mode function currently only supports selected third-party apps, including EVENTI, BookMyShow and Ticketmaster. Supported apps may vary by region. Please refer to actual availability. Ticket purchase mode only provides device-level reminders and technical optimizations during the ticket-buying process. It does not take part in any ticketing operations such as inventory checks, reservations, or order handling. Actual purchase success depends on many factors, including ticketing policies, supply and demand, and network conditions. This feature does not guarantee any ticket purchase success.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³² Google and Gemini are trademarks of Google LLC. Check responses. Setup required. Compatibility and availability vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³³ Google and Android are trademarks of Google LLC. Available on select devices, and internet connection is required. Works on compatible apps and surfaces. Results may vary depending on visual matches. Check responses for accuracy.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³⁴ Xiaomi Offline Communication requires a SIM card and a logged-in Xiaomi account to function. It supports up to 500 meters of voice calls for POCO X8 Pro Max and up to 1 kilometer of voice calls for POCO X8 Pro, in open, unobstructed environments. This feature is only available for devices that support Xiaomi Offline Communication. Feature availability may vary by region. Please consult local resellers for more details. Actual call quality may vary depending on environmental conditions. Please refer to your actual experience. This feature is not designed or intended for emergency or life-saving communications.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³⁵ Use of eSIM requires a wireless service plan. This service plan may be subject to certain restrictions of use on switching service providers and roaming (even after contract expiration). eSIM availability may vary depending on country/region and carrier. For more details, please see Xiaomi official website and contact your carrier for more information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³⁶ Offer is valid for new Spotify Premium users only. Offer applies to Spotify Premium Individual except for Indonesia, India, and the United Arab Emirates, wherein the offer applies to Spotify Premium Standard. Redeem by Aug 8, 2026, 11:59 PM local time. Free trial, then monthly fee applies unless canceled (price varies by region). T\u0026amp;Cs apply. Full terms: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/support/terms/spotify-premium-terms/\"\u003ehttps://www.mi.com/global/support/terms/spotify-premium-terms/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³⁷ New users only (no prior trials of YouTube Premium, YouTube Music Premium, YouTube Red, or Google Play Music). Redeem by Aug 31, 2026, 11:59 PM local time. Monthly subscription fee starts at the end of trial (price varies by region). Cancel anytime. Terms apply. Redeem in the YouTube app. Full terms: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/support/terms/youtube-premium-terms/\"\u003ehttps://www.mi.com/global/support/terms/youtube-premium-terms\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENDS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy – \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" – drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making to accelerate the company's evolution and refresh the smartphone industry.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"709","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1774496630"},"common":null}